re-light,"Relight and enhance this exact image only. Preserve all characters, faces, hairstyles, skin tones, outfits, accessories, tattoos, hands, poses, proportions, camera angle, framing, composition, background, objects, and original art style exactly unchanged.Improve the existing lighting with professional cinematic lighting: balanced exposure, a clear natural key light, soft fill light on important subjects, subtle rim light for separation, realistic ambient bounce light, rich but gentle shadows, refined contrast, and natural depth. Enhance realistic light response on skin, hair, fabric, metal, and all materials while preserving their original textures and colors. Add subtle atmospheric depth and a polished cinematic color grade appropriate to the scene.High-quality detailed rendering, clean focus on the main subject, natural shadows, soft highlights, realistic material definition. Lighting and color correction only.Do not redesign or alter anything in the image. No new objects, no removed objects, no changes to character identity, facial features, expression, clothing, body, hands, pose, scene layout, or perspective. No plastic CGI skin, excessive bloom, harsh glare, oversaturation, distortion, text, or watermark,{prompt}
